WEBVTT

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:09.980
Where can I go to meet her?

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:19.160
What's wrong? Got a cold?

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:21.380
Hmm, maybe?

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.680
It is pretty chilly...

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.220
To meet Illya-oneechan?

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:07.380
<b>Episode 5 
The Little Lady Attacks</b>

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:09.520
It doesn't want to light...

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.320
It's never had any sort of maintenance.

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:14.340
A space heater?

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:16.740
Because it's so cold.

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:20.110
Bazett-san, you were outside?

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:24.210
Yes, I was placing barrier runes 
across the premises.

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:31.130
All they do is raise an alarm when 
a hostile has infiltrated their area,

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.420
but they might fend off surprise attacks.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:35.590
There, it lit.

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:39.350
Ah, the conveniences of civilization...

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:42.310
That should help a little with the cold.

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:44.300
Thank goodness!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:48.600
But they must have evacuated in quite a rush

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.440
if they left heaters and oil behind.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:55.760
Well, with a meteorite falling, 
I guess that makes sense.

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:57.860
Huh? Meteorite?

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:01.450
That crater in the middle of the city.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:04.830
Someone in town said it was made 
by a meteorite five years ago.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.990
Huh? But I heard it was a gas explosion.

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:12.540
No way it was a gas explosion.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.920
Our information is jumbled, then.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.500
Probably on purpose.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:21.770
So, what's the real reason, Gil?

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.560
Look, would you stop asking 
me every single time?

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:31.280
But you always look like you know something.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.220
I do not.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:35.530
See? That look.

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:37.690
This is exasperation.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:42.320
As you've guessed, it wasn't caused 
by a meteorite or a gas explosion.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.000
Five years ago, the Ainsworths,

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.700
or possibly someone else,

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.910
caused some kind of 
disaster that left that scar.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:53.340
Would you speak clearly,
instead of putting on airs

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:55.380
and saying "someone" and "some kind"?

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:59.860
Hey, aren't you a little snippy toward me?

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.090
Am I?

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:06.020
I don't know the details. Honest.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:09.970
After all, I was only summoned 
a few months ago.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:13.280
I have no way of knowing 
what happened before that.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:17.400
So let's have a more fruitful discussion.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.980
Like talking about how we'll 
storm the enemy camp.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:23.280
Or who Tanaka-san really is.

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:28.670
Hey! Tanaka-san, you can't scribble on the walls!

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:31.750
I'm not scribbling! It's passion!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.090
Let's do things right, Tanaka-san!

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:36.920
I'll help you try to get your memories back.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.340
Illya-san, some passion for you, too.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.180
What are you doing?!

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:45.150
Grandma got angry!

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:46.250
"Grand..."

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.970
For crying out loud, keep it down!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.520
Seriously,

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:54.320
who is she?

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.000
Jeez, that Tanaka-san!

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.940
She's acting just like a little kid!

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:07.300
That's way beyond the level of amnesia.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:11.210
I wonder what Tanaka-san's 
lost memories are of.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:11.950
Hmm?

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:15.910
Oh, I just found her to be a 
very mysterious person.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:18.560
Was she like that when you first met her?

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:24.130
Yeah. She has no idea where 
she's from or who she is.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:26.940
Oh, my...

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:30.770
I thought she might be involved 
with the Ainsworths,

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:34.620
but they didn't seem to recognize her at all.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.840
Then perhaps we should ask her directly.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:41.520
What does she remember? What did she forget?

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:42.470
Yeah...

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:45.860
That's...

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.190
Tanaka-san?

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.810
What are you doing?

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:55.970
That's dangerous!

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:58.280
The wind is strong today!

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:02.770
Illya-sa—

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:06.590
Tanaka-san?!

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.350
Tanaka-san, are you okay?

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:13.600
Tanaka-san?

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.380
It hurts!

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:19.170
Huh?!

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.870
Well, of course it hurts!

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:22.310
It only hurts?

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:29.780
She doesn't appear to have any injuries.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.320
Though I can't see much through all the mud.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.740
O-Oh, thank goodness.

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:38.440
For now, go wash the mud off, Tanaka-san.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.790
I'll go and get you a towel.

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.060
Towel! Towel!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.630
Towel... Towel—

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:50.660
<i>What's that?</i>

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:54.640
A puppet? No, it isn't.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.450
It's shaking.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:59.270
My, what a cute butt you have!

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:02.770
Don't help me down, okay?

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:06.200
Huh? Um... What?

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:07.790
I sense eyes on me!

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:10.240
You appear to want to ask me something!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.030
But I won't tell you!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:15.700
It's a matter of my dignity as a lady!

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:19.120
<i>What a cheeky butt...</i>

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:24.310
Uh, you tried to climb over the fence
since the school gate was shut,

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:28.380
but your feet didn't reach the ground 
on the other side, and you just froze?

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:30.730
How did you know?!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:36.390
You'd bare a lady's secrets to the whole world?

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:40.220
How about baring your cheeky kid's panties, too?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.390
Hey, Ruby!

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.030
Huh?

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.620
Is she crying now?

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:54.180
With so little change in what 
we can see, it's hard to tell.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.740
S-Sorry. Don't cry.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.130
I'll get you down now.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:01.160
I'm not crying.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.980
You don't have to get me down.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:04.120
<i>Huh?</i>

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.750
<i>What should I do with this butt?</i>

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:11.020
I-If I say not to help me down three times,

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:13.260
then you absolutely shouldn't help me down!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.000
Yeah, I get it now!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.640
I'll take that as just an act!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:20.050
So don't complain, even if I get you down!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.810
<i>All of sudden, I'm worn out.</i>

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.810
Are you okay?

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.830
You're not hurt, are you?

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:30.720
I was so scared.

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:33.240
I thought I might be stuck like that for—

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:34.950
For never!

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:36.970
I was only playing... Right!

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:39.390
I was just playing hang-and-swing!

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:42.160
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:44.960
Are you alone?

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.120
Wasn't someone else with you?

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:49.670
No! Absolutely not at all!

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:54.880
Um... Listen, about just now...

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.800
Yeah, it's okay.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:58.290
I won't tell anyone.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:00.140
After all, it's a lady's dignity.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.720
Hey, hey, what's your name?

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:06.410
Me?

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.330
I'm Illyasviel.

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:11.270
Since it's so long, everyone calls me "Illya."

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.240
I'm Erica!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.490
Thanks for helping me, Illya-oneechan!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.290
Y-You don't need to thank me.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:27.490
Yeah, forget the thanks! 
Just call me "Onee-chan" again!

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:29.170
Onee-chan?

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.460
What is it, Erica-chan?

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:36.130
Hmm? You're trembling again?

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.680
What's wrong?

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.430
You're that afraid of heights?

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:43.640
Listen, Illya-oneechan...

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:48.600
Don't show me to the bathroom, okay?

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:50.860
<i>That's why she's shaking?</i>

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:52.690
Can you still walk?

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.710
No? You need to go that badly?

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.320
What do I do?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:02.600
Illya-san! I washed up!

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.830
What did you wash, with your face like that?!

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:08.790
Who's this?

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.800
Hold on a moment, Tanaka-san.

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:13.090
I need to show her to the bathroom.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.660
The bathroom?

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.610
What a child!

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:21.100
I can go to the bathroom by myself!

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.590
That's not something to boast about, okay?!

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.170
...like a child.

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:25.810
Huh?

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:28.250
Could you not treat me like a child?!

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:31.960
I'm a lady! I can go pee by myself!

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.320
You're arguing about this?!

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.590
I don't need your help, Illya-oneechan!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:38.150
Don't try it, Erica-chan!

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.740
Not when your legs are shaking like that!

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:43.410
Sometimes, a lady can't back down!

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:46.620
Sometimes, a lady cannot afford to lose!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:48.960
At the least, that time isn't now!

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:54.580
I can't lose to this airheaded girl 
in bloomers with a muddy face!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.170
Huh?!

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:01.030
What are you doing, Tanaka-san?

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:01.980
Let go!

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.700
Why are you biting her?

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.060
Sorry, Erica-chan! I'll stop her at once!

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.530
She's really enduring it?!

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:15.550
If it hurts, you can say it hurts!

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.000
I'm fine as I am.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.490
Just how strong a front are you putting up?!

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:21.640
Ah...

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:23.410
Huh?

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:33.920
Um...

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:37.540
Illya-oneechan...

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:42.210
Don't.... change my clothes for me...

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:48.560
Hey, Illya, what were you doing outside?

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.860
A lot happened.

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:52.230
Who's that girl?

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:56.760
Uh, well... She's a girl who 
wet herself in front of me...

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.500
I didn't wet myself!

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:01.390
A girl who ran into an isolated shower.

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:02.540
What the heck?

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:04.920
Do you sense anything?

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:09.700
The detection runes I set on the 
premises aren't reacting...

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:13.210
We only have Tanaka-san's bloomers 
for a change of clothes.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:17.060
I'd appreciate it if you wouldn't soak 
my bloomers by wetting yourself!

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.670
I didn't wet myself!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:22.130
Well, a girl like her can't be an enemy.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:24.920
Huh? Where's Gil-kun?

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:27.860
Who knows? He wandered off somewhere.

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:29.220
Oh...

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:32.100
It would've been nice if he could've
provided a change of clothes...

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:37.520
A child who can't use the bathroom alone 
is ten years too young to wear bloomers!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.070
I'm not a child! I'm a lady!

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:43.580
Hey, Tanaka-san, go and wash 
your body and face, too.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.240
In that case, she should take a bath.

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:48.610
We have a bath?

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:56.900
I... I never knew it was possible 
to have a hot spring on a roof.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:59.670
He's seriously outrageous, isn't he?

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.910
Well, putting that aside...

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:10.060
Big baths are the best!

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.310
Incredible!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:14.300
So schools even have baths on the roofs!

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:17.270
A normal school wouldn't, though.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:21.130
Still, I can't believe there's even 
a Noble Phantasm hot spring...

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.690
Bazett-san, those wounds...

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.790
They're from our last battle.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:29.100
My healing runes have 
almost finished healing them,

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.750
so there's no need for concern.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.920
<i>That's right.</i>

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:36.070
<i>Even a superwoman like Bazett-san gets injured,</i>

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:38.150
<i>and it takes time for her to heal.</i>

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:39.920
<i>But...</i>

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.930
The water feels great!

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:48.950
Hey, Tanaka-san...

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.120
What is it?

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.350
I want you to tell me...

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.220
About yourself.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.310
About what you remember.

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:58.770
I don't remember anything.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.980
Anything is fine! If we have some kind of clue...

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:04.410
Why not try thinking in reverse?

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:06.490
From what point do you have memories?

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:07.740
Yeah!

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:11.000
If we knew what happened right 
after you lost your memory...

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:15.160
Perhaps we could deduce 
something from the situation.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.050
Tanaka-san, remember!

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:20.520
What's your first memory 
after losing your memories?

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:25.710
What are you talking about?

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:28.560
It was snowing.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:34.360
No one was around, and when 
I began to walk, my feet slipped.

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:37.940
The ground was cold, my hands and feet hurt,

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.650
and when I looked down, 
you were there, Illya-san.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.920
That's the moment you met me, then!

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:45.280
It was like fate.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:50.290
In other words, you lost your memory 
just before you two met?

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:53.780
That doesn't give us any new information.

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:57.110
I don't remember it,

00:14:57.110 --> 00:15:03.790
but before I met Illya-san, it felt like 
everything was dark and foggy.

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:08.090
I think I've always been on my own...

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:12.360
I'm sorry for asking something so insensitive.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:16.810
If it's a bad memory, you don't have 
to force yourself to recall it.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.150
Illya-san...

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.560
Wh-Wh-What was that for?!

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.930
To show that we've made up!

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:27.210
I saw you and Kuro-san doing it yesterday!

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:29.240
Oh, that.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.220
Ah, no...

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:37.270
Sexual issues are personal matters, 
so I shouldn't interject my thoughts.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:39.070
You're wrong!

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:41.040
Please don't treat it so delicately!

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.690
Huh? What? What's going on?

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:45.080
It's nothing.

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:49.920
But you should leave this area 
right away and wash yourself.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:54.070
Stop treating us like we're 
bad for one's upbringing!

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:01.060
Jeez, what's gotten into you, Tanaka-san?

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:04.760
Right now, I'm probably happy!

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:05.640
Huh?

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:08.610
Ever since I met you,

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:11.510
I haven't felt lonely, even without my memories.

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.030
I haven't felt scared.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:14.550
Tanaka-san...

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:21.500
So I thought maybe I didn't need 
to remember the past, but...

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:26.080
There's one feeling I just can't ignore.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:30.990
I will destroy the Ainsworths.

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:36.470
If I can accomplish that, I don't 
care what happens to me.

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:42.020
I don't understand it, but I feel 
like I must never forget that.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:48.940
I'll definitely do it!

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:54.070
Erica-chan?!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:59.320
It's not like I got soap in my eyes, 
and it started hurting!

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:03.040
No, you got soap in way more than your eyes!

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:13.950
You really are such a child.

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:17.370
I was able to wash my own face earlier.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.360
You didn't wash at all!

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:21.430
If anything, you just made it worse!

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:24.030
I washed myself, too!

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:26.400
You're saying that with your eyes all red?!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:38.130
I've never wet myself.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:39.700
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:39.700
Neither have I!

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:42.880
Jeez, why can't you two get along?

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:45.350
Just earlier, you suddenly bit her, too.

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:48.500
I don't understand it either, but...

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:52.540
I just can't stand this girl at all.

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.010
You're that straightforward?

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:59.770
I... I hate... you, too...

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:02.260
I can't just ignore this girl!

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:06.050
Listen, Tanaka-san, no matter how you feel,

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:07.900
you mustn't bite people.

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:09.120
Why not?

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:10.390
Why...

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.030
You said it yourself, Tanaka-san.

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:17.580
You don't like pain, and you don't 
like seeing me in pain more.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:19.490
So you should understand.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:22.620
You shouldn't do things to cause others pain.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:26.710
Hurting someone else without a reason is wrong.

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:29.260
Right after I just said that?!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.700
Tanaka-san, you idiot!

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:33.090
I'm not an idiot!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:36.130
Ah, jeez, take it outside, you three!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.810
You really are an idiot!

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:39.340
That's mean!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:41.100
Oh, it's Papa.

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:43.440
He came to pick me up!

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:50.190
Oh, wait, Erica-chan!

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.870
Good grief...

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:55.070
What in the world is with that child, anyway?

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.330
What's wrong, Ruby?

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.150
Why the antenna?

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:00.610
Papa!

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:03.920
Erica, so this is where you were?

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.370
Oh, and that's...

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.130
Illya-oneechan!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:10.080
I see...

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:14.160
Thank you for taking care of my daughter.

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:15.680
No, it was nothing.

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.300
I'll open the gate.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:21.200
Thank you.

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:23.880
Even so...

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:27.560
It's cold...

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:30.190
I think it's because you're 
wearing such light clothing!

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:35.370
I rarely leave my house, 
so I forget how cold it is outside...

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:38.820
Papa, for a gentleman, you're such a klutz!

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:41.530
<i>Like father, like daughter?</i>

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:47.370
My daughter was supposed to 
be attending this school.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:48.920
Even though it's ruined now,

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:52.680
she sometimes slips out of the 
house to come here and play.

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:54.540
I see.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.180
I'm not playing!

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:57.880
I'm acting like a lady!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:19:59.110
Yes, yes.

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:03.180
Can you hear me? Can you hear me?

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.600
Nee-san, it's Sapphire.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:06.580
What's this?

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:08.900
It's been so long since we used telephone mode!

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:11.060
We've got a call from Sapphire-chan!

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:13.420
Thank goodness. I got through.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.270
This is your sister!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:18.590
You're safe, then? Where are you now?!

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:20.070
In the enemy's atelier.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:24.000
I was captured with Miyu-sama,

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.590
but Miyu-sama waited for 
a chance to let me escape.

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:30.370
I've been hiding until now, unable to act.

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:32.300
The interference is awful.

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:34.080
It must be the barrier's influence.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.760
I can contact you because 
the barrier's weakened,

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:39.090
but please be careful.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:42.430
Good grief, I'm always telling you, aren't I?

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:45.200
You can't leave the house on your own.

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:50.350
But, but, I really wanted to see for myself.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.180
I see. So, what did you think?

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:54.510
Well...

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:56.610
<i>What are they talking about?</i>

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:59.980
<i>Well, it doesn't matter. 
I'll just fix this for now.</i>

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:06.600
The barrier weakened because the 
Ainsworth family head went outside.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:12.280
She's a little less reliable than I'd 
heard, but she was really kind!

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:14.810
I see. That's good.

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:17.960
<i>Huh? That voice...</i>

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:19.380
The enemy's...

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:21.210
The Ainsworth's...

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.020
Shall we go home, then?

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:25.930
<i>This voice is...</i>

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:27.890
...leader is heading your way.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:36.020
Listen carefully to this voice.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:41.700
I am Darius Ainsworth, 
head of the Ainsworth family.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.110
That is your true enemy.

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:47.780
What a tasteless alarm.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:35.970
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.470 --> 00:23:26.260
For the starting bell, it's absolutely tasteless.

00:23:26.260 --> 00:23:28.920
Erica-chan, you tricked us?

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.720
Stand back! You should stay out of this!

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:34.010
Don't worry, it will be over soon.

00:23:31.910 --> 00:24:36.190
<b>Chilling Hostility</b>

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:35.840
Aren't you used to it?
